<main class="simulator-shell">
  <header class="simulator-header">
    <div class="brand-lockup">
      <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">玉</span>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">PACHINKO LAB / STEP 02</p>
        <h1>ORBIT <span>遊技シミュレーター</span></h1>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="session-chip"><span class="status-dot"></span> SESSION ONLY <span class="chip-divider">|</span> SAMPLE DATA</div>
  </header>

  <div class="game-layout">
    <aside class="data-sidebar" aria-label="遊技情報">
      <section class="data-panel balance-panel">
        <header class="panel-heading"><div><span class="panel-kicker">PLAY DATA</span><h2>遊技情報</h2></div><span class="sample-tag">SAMPLE</span></header>
        <div class="main-balance"><span>現在の持ち玉</span><strong>4,250<small>玉</small></strong></div>
        <dl class="money-grid">
          <div><dt>投資額</dt><dd>¥3,000</dd></div>
          <div><dt>累計払出</dt><dd>1,240<small>玉</small></dd></div>
          <div><dt>差玉</dt><dd class="positive">+1,240<small>玉</small></dd></div>
          <div><dt>収支</dt><dd class="negative">−¥1,760</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </section>

      <section class="data-panel session-panel">
        <header class="panel-heading"><div><span class="panel-kicker">SESSION</span><h2>遊技データ</h2></div></header>
        <dl class="stat-grid">
          <div><dt>通常回転数</dt><dd>124<small>回</small></dd></div>
          <div><dt>ST回転数</dt><dd>0<small>回</small></dd></div>
          <div><dt>初当たり</dt><dd>2<small>回</small></dd></div>
          <div><dt>LUSH突入</dt><dd>1<small>回</small></dd></div>
          <div><dt>連チャン</dt><dd>0<small>回</small></dd></div>
          <div><dt>最高連チャン</dt><dd>6<small>回</small></dd></div>
          <div class="stat-wide"><dt>累計打ち出し数</dt><dd>1,620<small>玉</small></dd></div>
        </dl>
      </section>

      <section class="data-panel history-panel">
        <header class="panel-heading"><div><span class="panel-kicker">HISTORY</span><h2>大当たり履歴</h2></div><span class="history-count">3</span></header>
        <ol class="history-list">
          <li><time>10:42</time><span class="history-type">10R</span><span class="history-mode">LUSH</span></li>
          <li><time>10:28</time><span class="history-type">3R</span><span class="history-mode">通常</span></li>
          <li><time>10:04</time><span class="history-type">7R</span><span class="history-mode">初当たり</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="sample-note">数値・履歴は画面用の仮データです。</p>
      </section>
    </aside>

    <%= render "board" %>

    <aside class="operation-sidebar" aria-label="操作パネル">
      <section class="operation-panel state-panel">
        <header class="panel-heading"><div><span class="panel-kicker">MACHINE STATUS</span><h2>遊技状態</h2></div></header>
        <div class="machine-state"><i class="state-light"></i><strong>待機中</strong><span>UI SAMPLE</span></div>
        <div class="hold-summary"><span>保留</span><div class="hold-lights" aria-label="保留サンプル 1個"><i class="hold-on"></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><small>1 / 4</small></div>
      </section>

      <section class="operation-panel control-panel">
        <header class="panel-heading"><div><span class="panel-kicker">PLAYER CONTROLS</span><h2>操作パネル</h2></div><span class="sample-tag">未接続</span></header>

        <div class="power-control">
          <div class="power-heading"><label for="launch-power">発射強度</label><output id="power-readout" for="launch-power">62%</output></div>
          <input id="launch-power" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="62" aria-describedby="controls-note">
          <div class="power-scale"><span>弱</span><span>中</span><span>強</span></div>
        </div>

        <fieldset class="control-group" disabled aria-describedby="controls-note">
          <legend>打ち出し強度</legend>
          <div class="strength-buttons">
            <button type="button" class="strength-button weak">弱打ち</button>
            <button type="button" class="strength-button medium">中打ち</button>
            <button type="button" class="strength-button strong">強打ち</button>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="control-group control-actions" disabled aria-describedby="controls-note">
          <legend>操作</legend>
          <div class="action-buttons">
            <button type="button" class="action-button stop-button">■ <span>打ち出し停止</span></button>
            <button type="button" class="action-button">Ⅱ <span>一時停止・再開</span></button>
            <button type="button" class="action-button">↻ <span>リセット</span></button>
            <button type="button" class="action-button investment-button">＋ <span>追加投資</span></button>
          </div>
        </fieldset>
        <p id="controls-note" class="controls-note">ボタンは見本表示です。ゲームロジック未接続。</p>

        <details class="physics-calibration">
          <summary>物理検証・入賞率</summary>
          <label for="target-hit-rate">目標入賞率 (%)</label>
          <div class="target-rate-control">
            <input id="target-hit-rate" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.1" placeholder="未設定" inputmode="decimal">
            <button id="apply-target-rate" type="button">適用</button>
          </div>
          <p id="target-rate-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">目標値は未設定</p>
          <dl class="physics-stat-grid">
            <div><dt>完了試行</dt><dd id="physics-completed">0</dd></div>
            <div><dt>保留</dt><dd id="physics-pending">0</dd></div>
            <div><dt>ヘソ入賞</dt><dd id="physics-hits">0</dd></div>
            <div><dt>実測率</dt><dd id="physics-rate">—</dd></div>
            <div><dt>目標差</dt><dd id="physics-rate-difference">—</dd></div>
          </dl>
          <div class="strength-trial-stats" aria-label="発射強度別の試行結果">
            <p>弱 <span id="physics-weak-stats">0件 / —</span></p>
            <p>中 <span id="physics-medium-stats">0件 / —</span></p>
            <p>強 <span id="physics-strong-stats">0件 / —</span></p>
          </div>
          <p class="calibration-note">完了試行は入賞または排出。流下中・取消は実測率の分母に含めません。</p>
        </details>
      </section>
    </aside>
  </div>

  <footer class="simulator-footer">
    <span>ORBIT / ORIGINAL PACHINKO SIMULATOR</span>
    <span>盤面表示・数値・操作はサンプル。物理演算・抽選・払出は未実装です。</span>
  </footer>
</main>
